{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܫܩܝܼܠܔ ܠܝܼ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܐܲܝܟ݂ ܐܵܡܪܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܓܵܢܝܼ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܥܪܘܿܩܝ ܠܛܘܼܪܵܟ݂ܝ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܛܲܝܪܵܐ؟“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܗܵܐ، ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܒܸܡܬܵܚܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܩܸܫܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܘܼܕܸܪܗܘܿܢ ܓܹܐܪ̈ܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܠܔ ܡܸܠܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܪܲܦܘܼܝܹܐ ܒܚܸܫܟܵܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܬܪ̈ܘܼܨܹܐ ܕܠܸܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܫܲܬܐܸܣܹ̈ܐ ܦܵܝܫܝܼ ܬܠܝܼܚܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܕܝܼ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܵܐ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܗܲܝܟܠܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܟܘܼܪܣܝܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܝܢܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܚܵܙܝܼ، ܛܸܠܦܵܦܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܒܵܚܪܝܼ ܠܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܒܵܚܹܪ ܠܙܲܕܝܼܩܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܒܝܼܫܵܐ ܘܠܡܲܚܸܒܵܢܵܐ ܕܛܠܘܼܡܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܣܵܢܝܵܐ ܓܵܢܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܥܪܹܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܦܲܚܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܘܼܪܵܐ، ܘܟܸܒܪܝܼܬ، ܘܦܵܘܚܵܐ ܚܲܡܝܼܡܵܐ؛ ܣܵܗܡܵܐ ܕܟܵܣܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܟܹܐ ܡܲܚܸܒ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܪ̈ܘܼܨܹܐ ܒܸܬ ܚܵܙܝܼ ܠܦܵܬܹܗ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}